printer-driver-fp620kp (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * CUPS filter and USB backend for ESC/P2K, with status readback.
  * PPD with 180x180, 360x180 and 360x360 dpi modes; 360x180
    unidirectional is the default.
  * Add fp620kp-setup helper for queue creation.

